{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14801","headline":"和太常王卿立秋日即事 · 卢纶","name":"和太常王卿立秋日即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嵩高云日明，潘岳赋初成。\n篱槿花无色，堦桐叶有声。\n绦纱垂簟净，白羽拂衣轻。\n鸿鴈悲天远，龟鱼觉水清。\n别弦添楚思，牧马动边情。\n田雨农官问，林风苑吏惊。\n松篁终茂盛，蓬艾自衰荣。\n遥仰凭轩夕，惟应喜宋生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}